With iOS 27.3 beta 2, Apple is partially solving a common <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-duo/">iPhone Duo</a> complaint. There's a new feature for unlocking the device with the front camera, which we've tested out.<br/>
<br/>
